WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.635
Everyone knows who won.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.272
But not everyone knows how.

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:12.211
We are about to ask the biggest
question in a generation.

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:16.249
In or out? And we need a leader.

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:20.787
(EXHALES)

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.022
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC) ♪

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:25.691
DOMINIC CUMMINGS:<i> We need to
 understand who our voters are.</i>

00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:26.893
Appeal to their hearts.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.862
People are feeling angrier,
ignored. Is it immigration?

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:31.230
You can be honest.
Is it race?

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.132
Which countries don't you like?

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.767
-New people come in--
-We get squeezed out.

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:37.002
CUMMINGS:<i> We want to return to
 a time when we knew our place,</i>

00:00:37.369 --> 00:00:39.139
and when things made sense.

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:41.107
Fictional or not.

00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:43.676
<i> How to change
 the course of history:</i>

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:46.079
-We have to hack
the political system.
-Hack it?

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:48.748
I'm talking about altering
the matrix of politics.

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:50.250
ZACK MASSINGHAM:
<i> Social media platforms</i>

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.051
are designed
to find like-minded people.

00:00:52.151 --> 00:00:54.320
Our software will locate
and target

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.089
<i> people that no campaign
 has ever targeted before.</i>

00:00:57.457 --> 00:01:00.360
<i> People who don't,
 and have never voted.</i>

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:04.163
<i> Three million extra votes
 that the other side</i>

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:07.167
have no idea exist.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:11.237
CUMMINGS:<i> This is an insurgence
 against the establishment.</i>

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.371
We're going to build something

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:14.607
<i> that will restack the odds
 in our favor.</i>

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.408
WOMAN: What are your
expectations, realistically?

00:01:16.508 --> 00:01:18.044
To create the biggest
political upset

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.545
since the fall
of the Berlin Wall.

00:01:20.012 --> 00:01:21.714
-Ready to launch?
-Yeah.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.354
Let's take back control!
Let's take back control!

00:01:29.021 --> 00:01:31.124
Now, the fight
for Britain begins!

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:35.595
You are feeding a toxic culture
of fear and hate.

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:40.500
You can't close the box
once it's been opened.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.503
It's your edge, newly found.

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.472
CUMMINGS:
<i>There is a new politics in town.</i>

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:48.941
One that you cannot control.

00:01:49.274 --> 00:01:53.446
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

